---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>

 <!-- ABOUT HERO -->
 <section class="page-hero">
 <div class="container">

 <div class="eyebrow">
 ABOUT ORASOLU
 </div>

 <h1>
 Technology, Experience<br />
 <span>&amp; Knowledge</span>
 </h1>

 <p>
 ORASOLU is a technical knowledge platform built around more than
 13 years of hands-on experience across databases, cloud,
 infrastructure, DevOps, automation and enterprise technology.
 </p>

 </div>
 </section>


 <!-- PERSON BEHIND ORASOLU -->
 <section class="section about-person-section">
 <div class="container">

 <div class="about-person">

 <div class="about-person-photo">

 <img
 src="/images/achitha-rathnayake.png"
 alt="Achitha Rathnayake"
 />

 </div>


 <div class="about-person-content">

 <div class="eyebrow">
 THE PERSON BEHIND ORASOLU
 </div>

 <h2>
 Achitha Rathnayake
 </h2>

 <div class="about-role">
 IT Professional · Technology Practitioner
 </div>

 <p>
 An IT professional with over 13 years of experience working
 across enterprise technology environments, with hands-on
 experience spanning databases, cloud, infrastructure,
 DevOps, automation and technical operations.
 </p>

 <p>
 Oracle Database is a major area of expertise, alongside
 experience with PostgreSQL, MongoDB, cloud platforms,
 Linux, infrastructure technologies and automation.
 </p>

 <p>
 My work has involved architecture, modernization,
 migrations, performance, high availability, operational
 reliability and technical problem solving across
 complex technology environments.
 </p>

 <p>
 ORASOLU brings that experience together in one place —
 documenting practical knowledge, technical solutions,
 experiments, tools and lessons learned along the way.
 </p>


 <div class="about-actions">

 <a
  class="profile-linkedin-icon"
  href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/achitha-r/"
  target="_blank"
  rel="noopener noreferrer"
  aria-label="LinkedIn"
  title="LinkedIn"
>
  <svg class="social-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
    <path fill="currentColor" d="M6.5 8.5H3.2V21h3.3V8.5ZM4.85 3A2 2 0 1 0 4.85 7 2 2 0 0 0 4.85 3ZM21 13.85C21 10.1 19 8.3 16.25 8.3c-2.23 0-3.23 1.23-3.79 2.09V8.5H9.17V21h3.29v-6.18c0-1.63.31-3.21 2.33-3.21 1.99 0 2.02 1.86 2.02 3.32V21H21v-7.15Z"/>
  </svg>
</a>

 <a
 class="button button--secondary"
 href="/articles/"
 >
 Explore Articles 
 </a>

 </div>

 </div>

 </div>

 </div>
 </section>


 <!-- PROFESSIONAL SCOPE -->
 <section class="section section--soft">
 <div class="container">

 <div class="section-intro">

 <div class="eyebrow">
 PROFESSIONAL SCOPE
 </div>

 <h2>
 More than one technology.
 </h2>

 <p>
 A broad technology background built through years of
 hands-on experience across different platforms,
 environments and technical disciplines.
 </p>

 </div>


 <div class="expertise-grid">

 <article class="expertise-card">

 <div class="expertise-icon">
 ◉
 </div>

 <h3>
 Databases
 </h3>

 <p>
 Database platforms, architecture, administration,
 performance, security, availability and operational
 reliability.
 </p>

 <div class="expertise-tags">
 <span>Oracle</span>
 <span>PostgreSQL</span>
 <span>MongoDB</span>
 <span>RAC</span>
 <span>Data Guard</span>
 <span>Exadata</span>
 </div>

 </article>


 <article class="expertise-card">

 <div class="expertise-icon">
 ☁
 </div>

 <h3>
 Cloud &amp; Infrastructure
 </h3>

 <p>
 Cloud platforms, Linux environments, enterprise
 infrastructure and database infrastructure.
 </p>

 <div class="expertise-tags">
 <span>OCI</span>
 <span>AWS</span>
 <span>Alibaba Cloud</span>
 <span>Linux</span>
 <span>ExaCC</span>
 </div>

 </article>


 <article class="expertise-card">

 <div class="expertise-icon">
 ⚒
 </div>

 <h3>
 DevOps &amp; Automation
 </h3>

 <p>
 Automation, CI/CD, infrastructure as code and scripting
 across database and infrastructure environments.
 </p>

 <div class="expertise-tags">
 <span>Jenkins</span>
 <span>GitLab</span>
 <span>Ansible</span>
 <span>Terraform</span>
 <span>Shell</span>
 <span>Python</span>
 </div>

 </article>


 <article class="expertise-card">

 <div class="expertise-icon">
 
 </div>

 <h3>
 Migration &amp; Modernization
 </h3>

 <p>
 Platform migrations, modernization initiatives,
 technology transitions and migration strategies.
 </p>

 <div class="expertise-tags">
 <span>ZDM</span>
 <span>Data Pump</span>
 <span>XTTS</span>
 <span>RMAN</span>
 <span>GoldenGate</span>
 </div>

 </article>


 <article class="expertise-card">

 <div class="expertise-icon">
 ✣
 </div>

 <h3>
 Reliability &amp; Availability
 </h3>

 <p>
 High availability, disaster recovery, backup,
 recovery, business continuity and operational
 reliability.
 </p>

 <div class="expertise-tags">
 <span>RAC</span>
 <span>Data Guard</span>
 <span>MAA</span>
 <span>RMAN</span>
 <span>DR</span>
 </div>

 </article>


 <article class="expertise-card">

 <div class="expertise-icon">
 ◇
 </div>

 <h3>
 Technical Leadership
 </h3>

 <p>
 Technical advisory, architecture guidance, problem
 solving, client engagement and team guidance.
 </p>

 <div class="expertise-tags">
 <span>Architecture</span>
 <span>Advisory</span>
 <span>ITIL</span>
 <span>SLA / OLA</span>
 </div>

 </article>

 </div>

 </div>
 </section>


 <!-- ORASOLU PURPOSE -->
 <section class="section">
 <div class="container">

 <div class="about-purpose">

 <div>

 <div class="eyebrow">
 WHY ORASOLU
 </div>

 <h2>
 Document the work.<br />
 Share the knowledge.
 </h2>

 </div>


 <div>

 <p>
 ORASOLU is a place to document technical work that can
 be useful beyond a single project or environment.
 </p>

 <p>
 Articles, scripts, tools, experiments, migration
 approaches, troubleshooting techniques and lessons
 learned will gradually become part of the platform.
 </p>

 <p>
 The goal is simple: make practical technical knowledge
 easier to discover, understand and apply.
 </p>

 </div>

 </div>

 </div>
 </section>


 <!-- CONNECT -->
 <section class="connect-section">
  <div class="container connect-inner">

    <div class="connect-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">CONNECT</div>

      <h2>Follow the work beyond ORASOLU.</h2>

      <p>
        ORASOLU is the central hub for technical knowledge, projects and contributions.
        Professional and community profiles provide additional ways to follow the work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="connect-socials">

      <a
        class="connect-social connect-social-primary"
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/achitha-r/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="LinkedIn"
      >
        <svg class="connect-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill="currentColor" d="M6.5 8.5H3.2V21h3.3V8.5ZM4.85 3A2 2 0 1 0 4.85 7 2 2 0 0 0 4.85 3ZM21 13.85C21 10.1 19 8.3 16.25 8.3c-2.23 0-3.23 1.23-3.79 2.09V8.5H9.17V21h3.29v-6.18c0-1.63.31-3.21 2.33-3.21 1.99 0 2.02 1.86 2.02 3.32V21H21v-7.15Z"/>
        </svg>
        <span>LinkedIn</span>
      </a>

      <a
        class="connect-social"
        href="https://github.com/achitharathnayake"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="GitHub"
      >
        <svg class="connect-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.58 2 12.24c0 4.53 2.87 8.37 6.84 9.72.5.1.68-.22.68-.49v-1.9c-2.78.62-3.37-1.22-3.37-1.22-.46-1.2-1.12-1.52-1.12-1.52-.91-.64.07-.63.07-.63 1 .08 1.53 1.07 1.53 1.07.9 1.58 2.36 1.12 2.94.86.09-.67.35-1.12.64-1.38-2.22-.26-4.55-1.15-4.55-5.06 0-1.12.39-2.04 1.03-2.76-.1-.26-.45-1.31.1-2.73 0 0 .84-.28 2.75 1.05A9.2 9.2 0 0 1 12 7.12c.85 0 1.7.12 2.5.36 1.9-1.33 2.74-1.05 2.74-1.05.55 1.42.2 2.47.1 2.73.64.72 1.03 1.64 1.03 2.76 0 3.92-2.34 4.79-4.57 5.05.36.32.68.94.68 1.9v2.82c0 .27.18.59.69.49A10.28 10.28 0 0 0 22 12.24C22 6.58 17.52 2 12 2Z"/>
        </svg>
        <span>GitHub</span>
      </a>

      <a
        class="connect-social"
        href="https://sloug.org/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="SLOUG"
      >
        <span class="connect-sloug-icon">
          <img
            src="/branding/sloug-icon.png"
            alt=""
          />
        </span>
        <span>SLOUG</span>
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .connect-section {
    background: var(--soft);
    padding: 72px 0;
  }

  .connect-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .connect-copy {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .connect-copy h2 {
    margin: 14px 0 14px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .connect-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 760px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .connect-socials {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .connect-social {
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 9px;
    border: 1px solid #dfe4eb;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    transition:
      transform .18s ease,
      border-color .18s ease,
      box-shadow .18s ease,
      background .18s ease;
  }

  .connect-social:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: #cfd6df;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(17, 29, 44, .08);
  }

  .connect-social-primary {
    background: var(--orange);
    border-color: var(--orange);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(244, 90, 36, .18);
  }

  .connect-social-primary:hover {
    border-color: var(--orange);
    background: var(--orange2);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .connect-icon {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    display: block;
    flex: 0 0 17px;
  }

  .connect-sloug-icon {
    width: 19px;
    height: 19px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex: 0 0 19px;
  }

  .connect-sloug-icon img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .connect-social::before,
  .connect-social::after {
    content: none !important;
    display: none !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .connect-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .connect-socials {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .connect-section {
      padding: 56px 0;
    }

    .connect-socials {
      width: 100%;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .connect-social {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0 10px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 390px) {
    .connect-socials {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

